    why:"A frontier model formally designated as meeting critical cybersecurity capability thresholds—capable of finding and exploiting zero-days autonomously—being cleared for public release (even with gating) marks the transition point where AI model capabilities have crossed from theoretical concern into capabilities that previously required specialized human expertise, escalating the governance question from 'could this happen' to 'how do we manage this in production.'",
